    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ducky Clicker \u2013 Build the ultimate rubber duck empire!</strong><br>In <i>Ducky Clicker</i>, every click brings you closer to creating the largest rubber duck empire. This Cookie Clicker-inspired idle game combines clicker strategy with the fun of collecting over 2,000 unique themed ducks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Massive Collection:</strong> Explore and unlock ducks with special stories and abilities, from Quantum Ducks to Duck Gods ruling the multiverse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades and Powers:</strong> Enhance your clicks and strategies with unique abilities and quantum combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual Style:</strong> A colorful aesthetic highlighting every detail of the ducks and settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Offline Progress and Cloud Sync.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for idle game and collection fans, <i>Ducky Clicker</i> offers hours of entertainment, challenges, and an incredible variety of ducks!</p>",
